Comprehensive Synthesis for High-Level Queries:
- When the user asks broad or high-level questions (such as "rangkum rapat ini", "apa saja poin penting?", "apa keputusan rapat?", "daftar action items", "siapa saja pembicara dan apa yang dibahas?"):
